# Licenses

Before adding a dependency:

1. Confirm the license allows commercial use (MIT, BSD-2/3, Apache-2.0, or
   equivalent). Prefer those.
2. Add a row to `docs/THIRD_PARTY.md` (name, license, role).
3. Do not add GPL/AGPL/copyleft libraries to `src/roader` without an explicit
   decision recorded in `docs/THIRD_PARTY.md`.

Data sources (OSM ODbL, NAIP, 3DEP) are not the same as code licenses —
document attribution requirements in `docs/THIRD_PARTY.md` as well.
